    "question": {
      "en": "Arrange the following Election Commission of India (ECI) Structural Milestones in correct chronological order:\n1. Establishment of Election Commission of India as a single-member body\n2. First General Elections conducted across independent India\n3. President appoints two additional Election Commissioners for the first time (making it a multi-member body)\n4. Enactment of Chief Election Commissioner and other Election Commissioners Conditions of Service Act making ECI permanently multi-member",
